      <pubDate>Tue, 22 Sep 2026 15:59:54 +0000</pubDate>
      <description>&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/68e1fef3c0085.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/68e1fed6356a7.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/68e0c4df2226f.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/68e0c4c8bc276.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/68e0c4e3d3650.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/68e0c55bd0bae.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/68e0c4c98ac15.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/68e0c4c97ca98.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/68e0c4c4af5ab.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/68e0c4c8886fa.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/68e0c4de6dcbe.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/68e0c4e32ebf5.jpg"/&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Update:&lt;/strong&gt; Fixes&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;The previous download file seemed to be broken, and TKMM couldn't download and install it, due to hidden files that MacOS adds to folders. I've fixed the download file so it doesn't have any extra files, and should work now.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;Bugfix&lt;/em&gt;: Fixes the download&lt;br&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;br&gt;I've always been sad about the fact that you lose the Decayed Master Sword after completing the Great Sky Island, and have always been trying to find a way to get it back, so I made this is a simple mod that allows you to regain the Decayed Master Sword.&lt;br&gt;      What it does:&lt;br&gt;&lt;span class="GreenColor"&gt;-Places the Decayed Master Sword back in nearly the same spot in the Room of Awakening.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span class="GreenColor"&gt;-Makes it fuseable, with the Master Sword's ghost fuse.&lt;br&gt;-Gives it the Guard Enhance/Parry ability.&lt;br&gt;-Makes it unbreakable.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span class="GreenColor"&gt;-Allows for it to remain in inventory even after reload.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span class="GreenColor"&gt;-Makes it droppable, like the MSGNotFound Master Sword.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;      &lt;span class="RedColor SelectedElement"&gt;I have only tested this mod in patch 1.1.0&lt;/span&gt;, which is the only patch I can get my Ryujinx to run at the moment, so I haven't tested this mod on any other version. I assume that if you install it with TKMM, it'll be compatible with most, if not all versions, but again, I cannot test that. &lt;br&gt;      I'd love to hear if TKMM does make it work with other versions, so if anyone tries it, feel free to comment.</description>
