      <pubDate>Sat, 19 Sep 2026 16:33:40 +0000</pubDate>
      <description>&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6aaeb477065b6.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6aaeb67a87af1.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6aaeb67a8b5c6.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6aaeb67a9f1b0.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6aaeb67aa66f5.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6aaeb67aa9664.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6aaeb67ab2e80.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6aaeb67ab44fa.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6aaeb67ab4e51.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6aaeb67ab2f1a.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6aaeb67ab9674.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6aaeb67ac0e65.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6aaeb67acdc11.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6aaeb67ad7a76.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6aaeb67ada09e.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6aaeb67ae3557.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6aaeb67ae7198.jpg"/&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Update:&lt;/strong&gt; Emote Wheel!&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;Overhaul&lt;/em&gt;: Restored the Camera Animations and created an emote wheel in place of the whistle button&lt;br&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;br&gt;This mod now allows you to call an Emote Wheel to play an AS command, bntx(icon) and an SLink for the emote!&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Emotes so far:&lt;br&gt;&lt;span class="GreenColor"&gt;-&lt;span class="GreenColor"&gt;&lt;span class="GreenColor"&gt;&lt;span class="GreenColor"&gt;Take The L&lt;br&gt;-Renegade&lt;br&gt;-Scenario&lt;br&gt;-Behold!&lt;br&gt;-Floss&lt;br&gt;-Best Mates&lt;br&gt;-Orange Justice*&lt;br&gt;-Empty Out Your Pockets*&lt;br&gt;-Lucid Dreams*&lt;br&gt;-PopLock*&lt;br&gt;-Get Griddy*&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="GreenColor"&gt;&lt;span class="GreenColor"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span class="GreenColor"&gt;-Crackdown&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="GreenColor"&gt;&lt;span class="GreenColor"&gt;-Electro Shuffle&lt;br&gt;-The Robot&lt;br&gt;-Breakin'*&lt;br&gt;-Dance Moves&lt;br&gt;-Ride the Pony*&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;-Hype&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span class="GreenColor"&gt;*&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="RedColor"&gt;Face and eye texture animations still missing&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;If any of you want a specific emote from Fortnite(Easiest to port for me), let me know in the comments! I can even create personalized emotes for individuals who message me!(discord preferably)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;I can't guarantee I'll be able to make all of your requests since I need to work on rebirth of the goddess as well..&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;For the emotes already made, you can't fit them all(8 maximum) in the wheel but you can edit the json for the json in the EmoteConfig folder in romfs.(Fairly simple). I wouldn't even mind people uploading their emote wheel preset online but I don't really see the use&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;AI Use disclosure:&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;This mod has exefs files that allow for the emote wheel. I have used the latest GPT-6 with a Ghidra bridge to implement this much needed change. Big Thanks to The5thTear for the bridge program!</description>
