      <pubDate>Fri, 18 Sep 2026 08:49:28 +0000</pubDate>
      <description>&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6aacf8fb13dcb.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6ab195c5e9465.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6aacf8fabb636.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6aacf8fad5342.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6aacf8fb0cd77.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6aacf8fb15752.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6aacf8fb43694.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6aacf8fbae897.jpg"/&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h1&gt;Glideshot&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Recent changes:&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h2&gt;v0.9.4 changes&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Fixed npad hook call conflicting with self-recall. &lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Mods can now be run together.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;br&gt;Activation is now &lt;b&gt;ZL + L&lt;/b&gt; (sorry this was inaccurate for awhile)&lt;br&gt;Added &lt;b&gt;Arrowbound&lt;/b&gt;. Enable by selecting the Arrowbound emblem in the main menu. &lt;b&gt;Shoot an arrow and you will paraglide along its trajectory&lt;/b&gt;. Disable via the same emblem. &lt;b&gt;Still in early alpha status. Only works with slower bows/arrows. &lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Description&lt;/h2&gt;Hookshot substitute that uses the paraglider and a zonai helix "chain" visual.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Note&lt;/b&gt;: this mod is still in active development and may change considerably as development continues.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Controls&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Hold &lt;b&gt;ZL + L&lt;/b&gt; to enter aim mode. A green circle marks a wall the glideshot will accept. A red circle means it won't work.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Press &lt;b&gt;A &lt;/b&gt;to fire. The glideshot draws to the target at once and Link follows with his paraglider. &lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Press &lt;b&gt;B &lt;/b&gt;at any point to let go.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Requirements&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Requires Tears of the Kingdom &lt;b&gt;1.2.1&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Confirmed working on Switch. &lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Known issues&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;The chain's double-helix can look blurred past the halfway point on long shots.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Sometimes the target is missed by a bit or doesn't latch onto a climb when arriving.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;In emulators, you will see the mod by the name &lt;b&gt;zonai-hookshot&lt;/b&gt;. That's the one you want to enabled. This was its development name. I may go back to it once it more closely resembles the hookshot from prior games. For now, I don't want to mislead anyone. &lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Open source&lt;/h2&gt;Both this mod and its source code are fully open source and MIT licensed. You can find the source code &lt;a href="https://github.com/afiaka87/totk-mods/tree/main/glideshot" target="_blank"&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Disclaimer&lt;/h2&gt;Coded with help from Opus, Sol. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Credits&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;exlaunch by shadowninja108 and contributors.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;doctest (MIT); devkitPro.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;</description>
